{"message":"I checked your profile again. Your Green Account and Gold Account are correctly associated under your profile, and your former Light Blue Account remains closed.

However, no Silver Rewards Card account or card application record is currently visible in the account systems available to me. I therefore can’t confirm the application’s internal association or status, and I did not make any changes to it. This does not necessarily mean the application failed—the application may remain in a separate pending-review system until a decision is made.

Once the card is approved and added to your profile, the documented 0.2% Gold Account APY bonus should apply automatically while the card remains eligible and linked. Please rely on the expected email decision within 5–7 business days; if the card is approved but does not appear under your profile afterward, contact us for a profile-association review."}
